std.process — Process control
==============================

Functions for process lifecycle and environment. All
functions are `extern` — backed by the host runtime.

    module std.process


Functions
---------

### exit

Terminate the process with the given exit code.

    extern exit(code: int)

### getenv

Return the value of an environment variable.

    extern getenv(name: string) -> string

### argc

Return the number of command-line arguments.

    extern argc() -> int

### argv

Return the command-line argument at index `i`.

    extern argv(i: int) -> string
